            "final_answer": "Here are some great Japanese restaurants in Davao City that you might enjoy:\n\n1. **Sukidesu Modern Japanese Cuisine** - Located on Aurora Quezon Street in Poblacion, this place has a fantastic reputation with over 6,600 reviews and a rating of 5. They offer a variety of Japanese dishes and are known for their affordable bento meals.\n\n2. **Ryuko Japanese Kitchen** - Found on Juan dela Cruz Street in Poblacion, this restaurant is well-loved for its authentic Japanese comfort food.\n\n3. **Backstage Cafe Japanese Comfort Food** - Situated on P. Sobrecarey Street in Poblacion, it’s a cozy spot for enjoying classic Japanese dishes.\n\n4. **Japanese Tunnel** - Located on Beverly Hills Street in Matina Crossing, this restaurant offers a unique dining experience with a variety of Japanese options.\n\nIn addition to these, here are some other local favorites:\n- **Sukidesu Japanese Street Dining** in Lanang, rated 5 with 1,356 reviews.\n- **Tokyo Tokyo** at SM Lanang and SM Davao Ecoland, both rated 5.\n- **Katsu Country** at Junction Building, also rated 5.\n- **Makoto Ya Japanese Restaurant**, rated 4.9, is another great choice.\n- **Tori Yamu** at SM Lanang, rated 5, is popular for its ramen.\n- **Ginkaku Japanese Restaurant** in Matina, rated 5, is known for its delicious dishes.\n- **Kitsune Japanese Restaurant** in Matina, rated 4.6, offers generous servings.\n\nThese spots should satisfy your cravings for Japanese cuisine! Make sure to check their current menus and hours before heading out.",
